# L §5.7: "A later version states a new lifespan with replace K + [k] lives span: a death, a closed account."
# Under a cut before the replacing version ana is alive on 2025-08-01; under the model's cut she is not.
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

kind persons

version a
  cite s
  known 2020-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 1990-01-01..

version b
  cite s
  known 2025-09-01
  replace persons + [ana] lives 1990-01-01..2025-06-30

ask q1: ana in persons on 2025-08-01 as known 2025-08-15
ask q2: ana in persons on 2025-08-01
=== expect
q1: true
  cut 2025-08-15
q2: false
  cut 2026-01-01
